title SD-16: Handle Invalidated Crew and Certification Expiry (FR-70, no UC)
' Traces: UC-09, UC-10 shared fragment; FR-10, FR-49, FR-56, FR-64, FR-66, FR-70, FR-71; NFR-09
' Sources: DEC-19, DEC-43, DEC-51, DEC-53, DEC-56, DEC-58, DEC-59; sequence-diagram-review-round-2.md.
' Round-3 source: DEC-68; sequence-diagram-review-round-3.md.
actor "Clock" as Clock <<system>>
control ":RosterController" as RC
entity ":Certification" as CE
entity ":Crew" as Crew
control ":NotificationService" as NS
entity ":AuditLog" as AL

alt clock event: start of day after Certification expiry
  Clock -> RC ++ : checkCertificationExpiry(today)
  RC -> RC : findExpiredCertifications(today)
  loop each expired Certification
    RC -> CE ++ : validOn(today)
    CE --> RC -- : false (expiryDate < today)
    RC -> RC : checkCrewsUsing(technician)
    opt current or future Crew made invalid
      group atomic expiry and Crew save
        loop each affected Crew
          RC -> Crew : removeMember(technician)
          RC -> Crew : markNeedsAttention()
          RC -> AL : record(Clock, Crew removed; Needs attention)
          RC -> RC : findEligibleStandby(date)
        end
      end
      alt save still fails after 3 retries
        RC -> RC : retainPreviousState()
      else transaction committed
        RC -> NS : notify(crewEvents, removed Staff and eligible Standby)
        ref over NS : SD-15
        NS --> RC : notification outcome
      end
    end
  end
  RC --> Clock -- : check outcome
else called by an approval or Certification edit
  [-> RC ++ : handleCrewInvalidation(staff, dates)
  group joins the caller's atomic save (SD-10, SD-20 or SD-21)
    loop each affected Crew made invalid
      RC -> Crew : removeMember(staff)
      RC -> Crew : markNeedsAttention()
      RC -> AL : record(actor, Crew removed; Needs attention)
      RC -> RC : findEligibleStandby(date)
    end
  end
  [<-- RC -- : Van-days flagged, crewEvents and recipients
end
legend bottom
Clock checks at 00:00 after expiryDate; expiryDate itself is valid
(FR-10, DEC-59). Only invalid Crews are changed; Jobs stay on the Van.
Approval/edit callers commit Crew changes with their own changes,
then deliver returned crewEvents through SD-15. No delivery here
before the caller commits. The actor is carried in the call context.
SD-15 hides Draft roster events.
Account cleanup unassigns Jobs separately in SD-04 (DEC-60).
endlegend
@enduml
